In the world where every human is in a race of attaining more wealth, human relationships are left far behind. This Webcilo novel has articulated this harsh reality of life so well.
After making a failed investment, his paternal family accuses him of siphoning the family wealth and they throw him out of their family as if he never existed for them. During these crucial times all his friends turn their back towards him and let him endure the suffering all alone.
The life of story’s hero turns in a glimpse of an eye, from the dearest member of his friends and family, he becomes a pitiful homeless person. Even his closest friends start ignoring him and the bitter reality of human relationships exposed in front of him.
Soon after starting his life as a live-in son-in-law, he realizes that he has stepped into hell. His wife whom he thought to be his best companion turns to be the biggest disappointment of his life.
From doing all home chores to washing cloths and buying grocery, he was treated more like an animal than a husband. This wasn’t only worry of his life, even after spending three years with his wife; he hasn’t even felt the touch of her fingers.
